# Capture output is reproducible from source; never commit it.
#
# Every entry here is root-anchored with a leading slash, and that is
# load-bearing: an unanchored `bundle/` also matches `src/bundle/`, which
# silently kept the whole bundle module out of the first commit and turned CI
# into "cannot find module '../bundle/read.js'".
/bundle/
/unpacked/
/*.repropack
/demo/tmp/
/repropack-bundle/

